{"text": "Other includes only information that changes how we help him.\n\nHis doctors and school share safety and return-to-class plans. His family and doctors manage his medicine.\n\nStaff use the plan to check risk. The EA does not diagnose or change the program.\n\nThe EA follows the teacher, the IEP and the safety plan.\n\nIf there is a concern, follow the plan, tell the named staff member, stay calm, and record what you saw.\n\nAdapted keeps the same Grade 10 goals but changes how he learns. Modified changes the goals themselves.\n\nLiam's adapted program includes a flexible timetable, recovery time, and a quiet room for tests.\n\nThe decision is based on his learning goals, not his category.\n\nA good profile is short, clear and useful. It keeps high expectations and gives the right help. Thank you.", "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural", "audio": "category-h-slide-06.mp3", "words": [{"text": "Other", "start": 0.1125, "end": 0.4, "start_char": 0, "end_char": 5}, {"text": "includes", "start": 0.4125, "end": 1.0125, "start_char": 6, "end_char": 14}, {"text": "only", "start": 1.025, "end": 1.3, "start_char": 15, "end_char": 19}, {"text": "information", "start": 1.3125, "end": 2.0375, "start_char": 20, "end_char": 31}, {"text": "that", "start": 2.05, "end": 2.225, "start_char": 32, "end_char": 36}, {"text": "changes", "start": 2.2375, "end": 2.775, "start_char": 37, "end_char": 44}, {"text": "how", "start": 2.7875, "end": 2.9625, "start_char": 45, "end_char": 48}, {"text": "we", "start": 2.975, "end": 3.0875, "start_char": 49, "end_char": 51}, {"text": "help", "start": 3.1, "end": 3.375, "start_char": 52, "end_char": 56}, {"text": "him", "start": 3.3875, "end": 3.6875, "start_char": 57, "end_char": 60}, {"text": "His", "start": 4.0875, "end": 4.275, "start_char": 63, "end_char": 66}, {"text": "doctors", "start": 4.2875, "end": 4.8, "start_char": 67, "end_char": 74}, {"text": "and", "start": 4.8125, "end": 4.9625, "start_char": 75, "end_char": 78}, {"text": "school", "sta